# 统一行尾，避免 Windows 上反复出现 "LF will be replaced by CRLF" 警告
* text=auto eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.petpack binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.node binary
*.onnx binary
